                <note rend="inline" type="source">721.23/1713: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Peru</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Dearing</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-05-13T13:00:00-04:00">May 13, 1933—1 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>61. Your 141, May 12, 2 p.m. Department desires you to present note
                    immediately.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
